OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry and mostly cloudy. A
OL,7,Flittle patchy rain overnight, mainly
OL,8,Fin the east, otherwise dry and rather
OL,9,Fcloudy. Brisk southwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA little patchy rain at first,
OL,12,Fotherwise dry with some brightness
OL,13,Fbreaking through by the afternoon.
OL,14,
